    "    eg: Distplot\n",
    "\n",
    "2] Bi-Variate analysis\n",
    "-> 2 Features at a time\n",
    "    eg: Scatter plot\n",
    "\n",
    "3] MultiVariate analysis\n",
    "-> Multiple Features at a time\n",
    "    eg: Heatmap,pairplot"
